    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Tire Iron & Tires</h2><p>An improvised melee-and-mobility weapon built around a tire iron and a small supply of loose tires.</p><h3>Tires</h3><p>The item carries 3 Tires. Launch Tire, Ricochet Tire, and Tire Boost each consume 1 Tire. Reload Tires restores the supply to 3.</p><h3>Tire Iron</h3><p>1d8 bludgeoning.</p><h3>Launch Tire</h3><p>1d8 bludgeoning at 30/90 ft. On hit, the target makes a Strength save or is pushed 10 ft.</p><h3>Ricochet Tire</h3><p>1d6 bludgeoning. After striking the first creature, the tire can ricochet to a second creature within 10 ft for another 1d6 bludgeoning attack.</p><h3>Tire Boost</h3><p>Bonus action. Spend 1 Tire to propel yourself up to 15 ft without provoking opportunity attacks.</p>",
      "chat": "<p></p>"
    },
